voxelslam.hpp -- shared node declarations and inline preprocessing.

1. Add offline host hooks and carry LiDAR tickets through upstream queues.
2. Retain validated long-duration points instead of silently truncating them.
3. Make LiDAR dequeue and IMU/prior-readiness observation race-free, expose
   waiting state, and acknowledge sweeps consumed without estimator work.
4. Replace process termination on missing IMU/map input with catchable errors.
5. Rotate body-frame attitude covariance into the world frame consistently.

Every hunk has an in-source `voxelslam_bridge:` rationale. The complete file
delta is generated with `diff -U3` and applied with zero fuzz.

